#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: woo-invoice-payment-method.php
msgid "WooCommerce Invoice Payment Method"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: woo-invoice-payment-method.php
msgid "https://github.com/SourovCodes/woo-invoice-payment-method"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: woo-invoice-payment-method.php
msgid "Adds a Pay by invoice payment method to the WooCommerce checkout, offered only to the organizations a shop has approved for it, on the payment terms and credit limit it set them."
msgstr "Fügt der WooCommerce-Kasse die Zahlungsart Kauf auf Rechnung hinzu — angeboten nur den Organisationen, die der Shop dafür freigegeben hat, zu den Zahlungszielen und Kreditlimits, die er ihnen gesetzt hat."

#. Author of the plugin
